  "question": {
    "text": "The locus of a point <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> moving under the condition that the line <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></math> is a tangent to the hyperbola <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is a conic, with eccentricity equal to",
